### Verbo PUT – atualiza 
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/cliente/2 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Arthur Paim",
  "cpf": "222",
  "telefone": "8888"
}

### Verbo DELETE – excluir
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/cliente/3 HTTP/1.1